# Productions/ exclude + negations go LAST (after the extension globs above) so *.parquet/*.npy/*.pkl
# cannot re-ignore the committed, git-tracked Productions/ deps. Negate each dir AND its contents
# (the /** form) — git cannot re-include a file whose parent dir stayed excluded.
Productions/*
!Productions/Intersection_vocab/
!Productions/Intersection_vocab/**
!Productions/Black_list_models_in_runs.json
!Productions/FLiPS_ICML_light_subset/
!Productions/FLiPS_ICML_light_subset/**

# The TOP-LEVEL data/ dir holds tracked repro metadata (manifest.sha256,
# LICENSE, README). Re-include it explicitly (anchored to root) — the bare `data/` rule above
# still ignores nested */data/ runtime-output dirs elsewhere in the tree.
!/data/
!/data/**

# Local run output under the light subset — NOT part of the committed feature_computation_data/.
# The broad `!FLiPS_ICML_light_subset/**` negation above re-includes everything under the subset,
# so these run-output paths show up as untracked; re-ignore exactly them (last-match-wins) so a
# blanket `git add` can't pull classification logs/checkpoints into the public repo.
Productions/FLiPS_ICML_light_subset/Experiments/Batch_Classification_across_token_pairs/
Productions/FLiPS_ICML_light_subset/Experiments/banned_token_pairs.json
